1
00:00:00,627 --> 00:00:03,127
(Stuart:)and I'm not even sure
you think of me as a friend.

2
00:00:03,129 --> 00:00:05,379
(Stuart:)You have any idea
how that feels?

3
00:00:05,381 --> 00:00:07,881
(Amy:)We're so sorry.

4
00:00:07,884 --> 00:00:10,054
(Stuart:)I'm always the last one
anybody thinks of.

5
00:00:10,053 --> 00:00:11,683
(Sheldon:)Well, no, that's not true.

6
00:00:11,688 --> 00:00:14,188
(Sheldon:)I mean, sometimes
it's Koothrappali.

7
00:00:15,224 --> 00:00:17,354
(Sheldon:)But we're not
supposed to say that 'cause

8
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,390
(Sheldon:)he's a minority.

9
00:00:19,395 --> 00:00:20,445
(Stuart:)Bye.

10
00:00:20,446 --> 00:00:22,566
(Sheldon:)Stuart, wait.

11
00:00:24,033 --> 00:00:26,783
(Sheldon:)I do know what it feels like
to be left out.

12
00:00:26,786 --> 00:00:28,406
(Bert:)I know how it feels, too.

13
00:00:28,404 --> 00:00:31,404
(Sheldon:)All right, this is about me
and him; you're not part of it.

14
00:00:33,242 --> 00:00:36,582
(Sheldon:)Stuart, perhaps we do
take you for granted,

15
00:00:36,579 --> 00:00:38,379
(Sheldon:)and that is not acceptable.

16
00:00:38,381 --> 00:00:41,331
(Sheldon:)Please know that you truly
are a valuable member

17
00:00:41,334 --> 00:00:42,634
(Sheldon:)of our social group.

18
00:00:42,635 --> 00:00:44,415
(Amy:)Thank you.

19
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:47,390
(Sheldon:)You know, in fact,
I'd like to propose a toast.

20
00:00:50,893 --> 00:00:52,013
(Sheldon:)To Stuart.

21
00:00:52,011 --> 00:00:54,431
(Sheldon:)A fine man,

22
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:58,150
(Sheldon:)a good friend
and a wonderful guest.

